# BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore for the workspace support image: the root
# workspace that builds `cw` and its generated protobuf inputs only.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!third_party
!third_party/sqlx-sqlite-unused
!third_party/sqlx-sqlite-unused/**
!crates
!crates/**
crates/**/target
!proto
!proto/**
!libs/daemon-proto
!libs/daemon-proto/**
**/.tmp
